 "lede": "Dead jobs leave locks behind, and stalled workers stay attached to their queues. The agent finds both, shows what it would remove and clears them once the lead agrees. It sets how worker time is shared between quick updates and bulk loads. A retired machine is taken out of the fleet and its certificates are revoked. The lead also gets the trend in job run times, with the slowest step named.",
